{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55167","headline":"兵要望江南 医方第二十九（十六首） 十二 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 医方第二十九（十六首） 十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"人霍乱，吐泻有方高。\n生姜二（辛本作「三」）两须炮过，芭蕉一两去皮熬，五两大黄烧。\n（大黄炒过爲末，蜜爲丸，如梧桐子大，每服三丸，以利爲度；如不利，以米粥投药。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55167.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55167","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}